# YorkLanes env templates — copy these into the app folders:
#
#   cp apps/api/.env.example apps/api/.env
#   cp apps/web/.env.example apps/web/.env.local
#
# Fill in values from the database maintainer (SUPABASE_DB_URL, OAuth creds).
# Never commit apps/api/.env or apps/web/.env.local.
#
# Google OAuth setup: docs/tasks/auth.md
# Render hosting: docs/deployment.md (render.yaml blueprint)
#
# Render dashboard secrets (not stored here):
#   API:  SUPABASE_DB_URL, SESSION_SECRET, GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID, GOOGLE_CLIENT_SECRET,
#         GOOGLE_CALLBACK_URL (https://<web-host>/api/auth/google/callback)
#   Web:  PUBLIC_API_URL (= web origin), API_INTERNAL_URL (= API service URL)
#   Both: NODE_VERSION=22
